<!-- Mecha "Vector Frame", bands 7-8 and the rim: the ship that carries the Mawjig Vector Drive (docs/ideas.md, Vector Drive
     victory, Proposed). Ai-Generated-Proposal (2026-11-14), Infall: Ship Designs. Mecha high tech (race profile 10): the
     most hull of any race (a Hull Polarizer, GDD 8T), a heavy hull beam, two EVB-style threats, average shields.
     The drive is its Engines. It shares the heart of the ship with the Shields, so a player who wants the shields down
     must decide how hard to hit the room that holds the prize; the Servicing Core is next door so the Mecha can
     mend it fast. Every system carries its own power (Mecha). -->
